{"id":"472256442","kind":"article","title":"自主评分的间隔重复记忆系统比机器评分的系统更有效率","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7MGZ4wX4fenUQzR9248QfWU8GFeZbTFGaJRM"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-02-26","updated":"2022-10-15","votes":13,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":378,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","生成效应","交互设计","学习效率"],"summary":"作者认为，机器评分的间隔重复系统要求输入答案，会把每项复习耗时提高数倍；选择题虽然免去输入，却将主动生成转为辨认，可能削弱记忆编码。文章据此主张自主评分的系统能降低交互成本并保留提取练习。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/472256442","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"_gf81DDN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z87TFgTr98bz3MNFT26NhegyRCMgdkfNTBAzp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">交互是界面设计的成本中心</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，所以机器评分的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>给他们的用户带来了更大的成本。如果要求用户打字输入答案，那就很容易在每项任务上花费 2-4 倍的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"qgyyNWN_\">一些机器评分系统放弃卡片，转而使用选择题来规避输入成本。但生成任务就转变成了判别任务——对记忆编码的效果大打折扣；参见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3iJVoXtJBUJHq9Tb6i8Kv4EK7oNbriHh4N2y\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生成效应</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"0LQNUtIr\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"469542171\" href=\"#/post/469542171\">助记媒介依赖的卡片应是轻量级的</a></li><li data-pid=\"w7wRGk62\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"573838070\" href=\"#/post/573838070\">迁移恰当加工</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"6EW3hVGB\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7MGZ4wX4fenUQzR9248QfWU8GFeZbTFGaJRM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Self-graded spaced repetition memory systems are more efficient than machine-graded systems (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 交互是界面设计中的成本中心 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"472770296\" href=\"#/post/472770296\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 生成效应 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"455748242\" href=\"#/post/455748242\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"470682027","title":"现有的间隔重复系统不鼓励常青笔记的创作","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"486489705","title":"自主评分的间隔重复记忆系统可避免假阴性","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"472770296","title":"交互是界面设计中的成本中心","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"469542171","title":"助记媒介依赖的卡片应是轻量级的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"455748242","title":"生成效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}